## 🚨 VIOLATIONS (IMMEDIATE STOP)

### Forbidden Actions
- ❌ Creating .md without request
- ❌ Adding 8th or removing tools from MCP (must stay at 7)
- ❌ Leaving dead code
- ❌ Hiding errors/warnings
- ❌ Using mocks instead of real data
- ❌ False "success" claims
- ❌ Modifying 7-tool constraint
- ❌ Breaking FFI Chapel integration
- ❌ Removing datasets from models/

### Always Required
- ✅ Real implementations only
- ✅ Full error visibility
- ✅ Working builds
- ✅ Passing tests
- ✅ Clean code (no dead code)
- ✅ 7 tools exactly (EXPANDED)

