## ✅ SUCCESS CRITERIA

Task is complete ONLY when ALL of these pass:

### Rust Success
1. `cargo build --release` ✅
2. `cargo test test_exactly_7_tools` ✅
3. `cargo test --test integration_real_mcp` ✅
4. No dead code remains
5. 7 tools verified in protocol.rs

### Chapel Success (if applicable)
1. `cd ffi/chapel && make full-pipeline` ✅
2. `make test` ✅
3. `libchapel_ai.so` exists ✅

### Go Success (if applicable)
1. `cd mcp-servers/github && go build` ✅
2. `go test ./...` ✅

### Integration Success
1. All language components build
2. FFI integration works
3. Datasets accessible from Chapel training
4. Documentation updated (if requested)
5. All warnings visible and addressed

